## 2. How the Two Sides Talk to Each Other

Every request from Flutter follows this chain:

```
Screen Widget
    │ calls notifier method
    ▼
Riverpod Provider (AsyncNotifier)
    │ uses apiClientProvider (Dio)
    ▼
AuthInterceptor  ─── reads JWT from FlutterSecureStorage
    │ adds "Authorization: Bearer <token>" header
    ▼
HTTP Request ──────────────────────────────────────────►
                                                        │
                                          Express Router
                                                        │
                                          authGuard middleware
                                          (verifies JWT, attaches manager)
                                                        │
                                          Controller
                                          (validates body)
                                                        │
                                          Service
                                          (Prisma queries)
                                                        │
◄────────────────────────────────────── JSON Response
    │
ErrorInterceptor (watches for 401 → auto logout)
    │
Riverpod state updated
    │
UI rebuilds
```

